      <common:UUID>b87f9a2e-fd90-40f7-a9e4-1b2cc0fb857b</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Natural gypsum, treatment for sludge production</baseName>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Trattamento di gesso naturale per produzione fanghi.</common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Non-energetic raw materials</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>Dataset developed within the ARCADIA project in the context of the Ph.D. of Federica Carollo (Politecnico di Milano). 
The dataset relates to the treatment of 1 tonne of natural gypsum. 
The dataset is composed of 3-unit processes:  
1) Specific electricity consumption of toggle crusher (first grinding);  
2) Specific electricity consumption of the hammer mill (second grinding); 
3) Specific electricity consumption of the tertiary mill (third grinding).</common:generalComment>
      <referenceToExternalDocumentation type="source data set" refObjectId="56f351ef-95f0-4c4f-acb2-273a56388657" version="01.00.000" uri="../sources/56f351ef-95f0-4c4f-acb2-273a56388657.xml">
        <common:shortDescription>Carollo F. (2023). Circularity in construction and demolition waste management chain, Ph.D. Dissertation (Tutored by Rigamonti L., Ceruti F.). Politecnico di Milano. Background datasets from the EcoInvent database cut-off (v. 3.8) were used for the LCA study. </common:shortDescription>
      </referenceToExternalDocumentation>
    </dataSetInformation>
